# Blank template — real DocuClick sessions write HTML flow files and
# screenshots into these folders. Keep that out of git so a live-in-place
# output folder never leaks captured content into this public repo (see
# OutputTemplate/README.md: copy this folder out first).
/00 Inbox/*
!/00 Inbox/.gitkeep
/01 Prozesse/*
!/01 Prozesse/.gitkeep
/03 MOCs/*
!/03 MOCs/.gitkeep
/99 Archiv/*
!/99 Archiv/.gitkeep
/Attachments/*
!/Attachments/.gitkeep
